@startuml Sequence_6
hide footbox
title Scenario 6: Player Turn — Warrior Uses Potion to Heal

participant "ArenaBattleScreen" as Screen
participant "GameApp" as App
participant "BattleEngine" as Engine
participant "PlayerAction" as PA
participant "UseItem" as UI
participant "Potion" as Potion
participant "Warrior" as Warrior
participant "DefendBuff" as Buff
participant "GameState" as State

note over Screen, State
  Scenarios 6 and 7 occur within the same executePlayerTurn() call.
  Warrior (SPD 30) acts first → uses Potion.
  Goblin (SPD 25) acts second → still stunned, skips again (Scenario 7).
  This diagram focuses on the Warrior (player) phase.
  Note: DefendBuff from Scenario 2 expires here (turns: 1→0).
end note

Screen -> App : onUseItem(itemIndex, targetIndex)
App -> App : item = player.getInventory().get(itemIndex)
App -> Engine : executePlayerTurn(3, targetIndex, potion, 1.0)
Engine -> State : getPlayer() → Warrior

note over Engine : Iterating turnOrderSnapshot...\nProcessing: Warrior (Player)

Engine -> Warrior : beginTurn()
note over Warrior : Iterates activeEffects\ncalls DefendBuff.onTurnStart(warrior)
Warrior -> Buff : onTurnStart(warrior)
note over Buff : remainingTurns-- (1→0)\nreturns false (don't skip)
Buff --> Warrior : false
note over Warrior : DefendBuff.isExpired()? turns=0 → true\nDefendBuff.onExpire(warrior) called\nDefendBuff removed from activeEffects\ncanAct = true
Warrior --> Engine : true

Engine -> Engine : executeChosenPlayerAction(choice=3, ...)
Engine -> PA : consumeItem(warrior, goblin, [goblin], potion)
PA -> UI : new UseItem(potion)
PA -> UI : execute(warrior, goblin, [goblin])

note over UI : actor instanceof Player → ok\nitem != null → ok
UI -> Potion : use(warrior, [goblin], goblin)
Potion -> Warrior : heal(100)
note over Warrior : hp = min(maxHp, hp + 100)
Warrior --> Potion : done

UI -> Warrior : removeItem(potion)
note over Warrior : potion removed from inventory
Warrior --> UI : true

Engine -> Engine : pendingTurnFrames.add(TurnFrame("Warrior uses Potion."))
Engine -> Engine : sweepDeadEnemies()

note over Engine : Goblin phase follows next\n(see Scenario 7)

@enduml
